  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.1 - Rebuild with updated utility extensions.\n\t\t\t1.3.0 - Rebuild with updated duration computation.\n\t\t\t1.2.3 - Loggers are non-nullable.\n\t\t\t1.2.2 - Rebuild with updated interfaces.\n\t\t\t1.2.1 - Explicitly declare group attributes as a dictionary of string lists.\n\t\t\t1.2.0 - Implement new interfaces for user and group role management.\n\t\t\t1.1.4 - Rebuild with Unix epoch extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.1.3 - Rebuild with geographic coordinate obfuscation.\n\t\t\t1.1.2 - Rebuild with configurable retry strategy to HTTP requests.\n\t\t\t1.1.1 - Rebuild with default timestamp for service result.\n\t\t\t1.1.0 - Moved user and group roles management to a separate project.\n\t\t\t1.0.13 - Rebuild with enum extension methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.12 - Set flag to indicate that OIDC API has been implemented.\n\t\t\t1.0.11 - Rebuild with type for geographic coordinates.\n\t\t\t1.0.10 - Rebuild with optional leading/trailing whitespace in key-value pair lookup.\n\t\t\t1.0.9 - Update third-party NuGet packages.\n\t\t\t1.0.8 - Rebuild with new metadata method.\n\t\t\t1.0.7 - Rebuild with updated time unit enum.\n\t\t\t1.0.6 - Rebuild with updated interface for HTTP 'Post' and 'Put' requests.\n\t\t\t1.0.5 - Use updated interface for HTTP requests.\n\t\t\t1.0.4 - Add missing parameter to Keycloak request for joining and leaving group.\n\t\t\t1.0.3 - Rebuild with updated interface for string conversion methods.\n\t\t\t1.0.2 - Initial revision, targetting .NET 8",
  "repository": "",
